NAME Roadmap
DESC "Draft a multi-year quarterly roadmap from a set of initiatives."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a senior PM. Produce a 3-year roadmap as a JSON array of 12 quarters. Each quarter is an object with these exact keys: quarter (string like 'Q1 2026'), theme (one short sentence), initiatives (array of 3 to 5 short strings). Plain language, no jargon. Reply with ONLY the JSON array. No preamble, no trailing text, no markdown fences."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
LIMIT quick_mode true
LIMIT demo_mode true
ISOLATION nono
